      "isRule": true,
      "isFirstOrder": true,
      "rocqProof": "Lemma Prop_7_55__a_section_is_an_equalizer_rule : forall (A B : Vertex)(g : Edge A B)(f : Edge B A)(idA : Edge A A)(idB g_f : Edge B B)(Triangle_2 : Triangle g f idA)(Triangle_3 : Triangle f g g_f)(isId_2 : isId idA)(isId_3 : isId idB), Equalizer g g_f idB.\nintros_sigma ().\nassert (Hpremise1 : Σ (x_f__e : Edge A B)(Triangle_4 : Triangle g g_f x_f__e), Triangle g idB x_f__e). {\n  intros_sigma ().\n  destruct_sigma (@UnitR_rule A B g idB isId_3) as Triangle_6.\n  destruct_sigma (@UnitL_rule A B idA g isId_2) as Triangle_7.\n  destruct_sigma (@AssocL_rule A B A B g f g idA g_f g Triangle_2 Triangle_3 Triangle_7) as Triangle_8.\n  exact (g, Triangle_8, Triangle_6).\n}\nassert (Hpremise2 : forall (X : Vertex)(x w : Edge X B)(Triangle_4 : Triangle x g_f w)(Triangle_5 : Triangle x idB w), Σ (x_x__e : Edge X A), Triangle x_x__e g x). {\n  intros_sigma ().\n  destruct_sigma (@UnitR_rule X B x idB isId_3) as Triangle_7.\n  destruct_sigma (@ComposeUnique_rule X B B x idB w x Triangle_5 Triangle_7) as _.\n  destruct_sigma (@Compose_rule X B A x f) as f_x Triangle_8.\n  destruct_sigma (@AssocR_rule X B A B x f g f_x g_f x Triangle_8 Triangle_3 Triangle_4) as Triangle_9.\n  exact (f_x, Triangle_9).\n}\nassert (Hpremise3 : forall (X : Vertex)(u v : Edge X A)(x : Edge X B)(Triangle_4 : Triangle u g x)(Triangle_5 : Triangle v g x), u = v). {\n  intros_sigma ().\n  destruct_sigma (@SectionIntro_rule A B g f idA Triangle_2 isId_2) as isSection_2.\n  destruct_sigma (@Prop_7_35__sections_are_mono_rule A B g isSection_2) as isMono_2.\n  destruct_sigma (@MonoElim_rule A B X g u v x Triangle_4 Triangle_5 isMono_2) as _.\n  exact eq_refl.\n}\ndestruct_sigma (@EqualizerIntro_rule A B B g g_f idB Hpremise1 Hpremise2 Hpremise3) as Equalizer_3.\nexact Equalizer_3.\nQed.\n",
      "proved": false
    },
