      "isRule": true,
      "isFirstOrder": true,
      "rocqProof": "Lemma Prop_11_10_2___left_square_of_a_pullback_rectangle_rule : forall (A B C D E F : Vertex)(f : Edge A B)(g : Edge B C)(f' : Edge D E)(g' : Edge E F)(a : Edge A D)(b : Edge B E)(c : Edge C F)(gf : Edge A C)(g'f' : Edge D F)(d : Edge A E)(Triangle_2 : Triangle f g gf)(Triangle_3 : Triangle f' g' g'f')(Triangle_4 : Triangle f b d)(Triangle_5 : Triangle a f' d)(Pullback_2 : Pullback g b g' c)(Pullback_3 : Pullback gf a g'f' c), Pullback f a f' b.\nintros_sigma ().\nassert (Hpremise1 : Σ (x_f__p : Edge A E)(Triangle_6 : Triangle f b x_f__p), Triangle a f' x_f__p). {\n  intros_sigma ().\n  exact (d, Triangle_4, Triangle_5).\n}\nassert (Hpremise2 : forall (X : Vertex)(x : Edge X B)(y : Edge X D)(w : Edge X E)(Triangle_6 : Triangle x b w)(Triangle_7 : Triangle y f' w), Σ (x__x__y_ : Edge X A)(Triangle_8 : Triangle x__x__y_ f x), Triangle x__x__y_ a y). {\n  intros_sigma ().\n  destruct_sigma (@Compose_rule X B C x g) as g_x Triangle_10.\n  destruct_sigma (@Compose_rule X E F w g') as g'_w Triangle_11.\n  destruct_sigma (@PullbackCommute_rule B C E F g b c g' Pullback_2) as c_g Triangle_12 Triangle_13.\n  destruct_sigma (@AssocL_rule X B E F x b g' w c_g g'_w Triangle_6 Triangle_13 Triangle_11) as Triangle_14.\n  destruct_sigma (@AssocR_rule X B C F x g c g_x c_g g'_w Triangle_10 Triangle_12 Triangle_14) as Triangle_15.\n  destruct_sigma (@AssocL_rule X D E F y f' g' w g'f' g'_w Triangle_7 Triangle_3 Triangle_11) as Triangle_16.\n  destruct_sigma (@PullbackExists_rule A C D F X gf a c g'f' g_x y g'_w Triangle_15 Triangle_16 Pullback_3) as x_g_x_y_ Triangle_17 Triangle_18.\n  destruct_sigma (@Compose_rule X A B x_g_x_y_ f) as f__g_x_y_ Triangle_19.\n  destruct_sigma (@AssocR_rule X A B C x_g_x_y_ f g f__g_x_y_ gf g_x Triangle_19 Triangle_2 Triangle_17) as Triangle_20.\n  destruct_sigma (@AssocL_rule X A D E x_g_x_y_ a f' y d w Triangle_18 Triangle_5 Triangle_7) as Triangle_21.\n  destruct_sigma (@AssocR_rule X A B E x_g_x_y_ f b f__g_x_y_ d w Triangle_19 Triangle_4 Triangle_21) as Triangle_22.\n  destruct_sigma (@PullbackUnique_rule B C E F X g b c g' g_x w f__g_x_y_ x Triangle_20 Triangle_22 Triangle_10 Triangle_6 Pullback_2) as _.\n  exact (x_g_x_y_, Triangle_19, Triangle_18).\n}\nassert (Hpremise3 : forall (X : Vertex)(x : Edge X B)(y : Edge X D)(u v : Edge X A)(Triangle_6 : Triangle u f x)(Triangle_7 : Triangle u a y)(Triangle_8 : Triangle v f x)(Triangle_9 : Triangle v a y), u = v). {\n  intros_sigma ().\n  destruct_sigma (@Compose_rule X B C x g) as g_x Triangle_10.\n  destruct_sigma (@AssocL_rule X A B C u f g x gf g_x Triangle_6 Triangle_2 Triangle_10) as Triangle_11.\n  destruct_sigma (@AssocL_rule X A B C v f g x gf g_x Triangle_8 Triangle_2 Triangle_10) as Triangle_12.\n  destruct_sigma (@PullbackUnique_rule A C D F X gf a c g'f' g_x y u v Triangle_11 Triangle_7 Triangle_12 Triangle_9 Pullback_3) as _.\n  exact eq_refl.\n}\ndestruct_sigma (@PullbackIntro_rule A B D E f a b f' Hpremise1 Hpremise2 Hpremise3) as Pullback_5.\nexact Pullback_5.\nQed.\n",
      "proved": false
