      "isRule": true,
      "isFirstOrder": true,
      "rocqProof": "Lemma Prop_11_18_1___monos_are_pullback_stable_rule : forall (P A B C : Vertex)(p : Edge P A)(q : Edge P B)(f : Edge A C)(g : Edge B C)(isMono_2 : isMono f)(Pullback_2 : Pullback p q g f), isMono q.\nintros_sigma ().\nassert (Hpremise1 : forall (X : Vertex)(u v : Edge X P)(w : Edge X B)(Triangle_2 : Triangle u q w)(Triangle_3 : Triangle v q w), u = v). {\n  intros_sigma ().\n  destruct_sigma (@PullbackCommute_rule P A B C p q f g Pullback_2) as f_p Triangle_4 Triangle_5.\n  destruct_sigma (@Compose_rule X P A u p) as p_u Triangle_6.\n  destruct_sigma (@Compose_rule X P A v p) as p_v Triangle_7.\n  destruct_sigma (@Compose_rule X B C w g) as g_w Triangle_8.\n  destruct_sigma (@AssocL_rule X P B C u q g w f_p g_w Triangle_2 Triangle_5 Triangle_8) as Triangle_9.\n  destruct_sigma (@AssocL_rule X P B C v q g w f_p g_w Triangle_3 Triangle_5 Triangle_8) as Triangle_10.\n  destruct_sigma (@AssocR_rule X P A C u p f p_u f_p g_w Triangle_6 Triangle_4 Triangle_9) as Triangle_11.\n  destruct_sigma (@AssocR_rule X P A C v p f p_v f_p g_w Triangle_7 Triangle_4 Triangle_10) as Triangle_12.\n  destruct_sigma (@MonoElim_rule A C X f p_u p_v g_w Triangle_11 Triangle_12 isMono_2) as _.\n  destruct_sigma (@PullbackUnique_rule P A B C X p q f g p_u w u v Triangle_6 Triangle_2 Triangle_7 Triangle_3 Pullback_2) as _.\n  exact eq_refl.\n}\ndestruct_sigma (@MonoIntro_rule P B q Hpremise1) as isMono_4.\nexact isMono_4.\nQed.\n",
      "proved": false
